  <jpcrp_cor:ResearchAndDevelopmentExpensesIncludedInGeneralAndAdministrativeExpensesAndManufacturingCostForCurrentPeriodTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">
&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt;※３　一般管理費に含まれる研究開発費の総額&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 647.99999999999999999999999999px"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
